message: >-
  If you use this research demo or cite the software, please use the metadata
  below. Prefer the concept DOI to cite all versions.
type: software
title: "Breast Ultrasound Lesion Segmentation: an in-browser research demo on BUSI with external validation"
version: 1.0.1
date-released: "2026-11-22"
authors:
