    given-names: Surabhi
repository-code: "https://github.com/surabhif/Breast-ultrasound-lesion-segmentation"
url: "https://surabhif.github.io/Breast-ultrasound-lesion-segmentation/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  High-school research demo: in-browser ResNet-18 U-Net lesion segmentation on
  BUSI with external checks on BUS-BRA, BrEaST, and BUS-UCLM. Project software
  v1.0.1; served model remains v1.0.0 (weights unchanged). Not for clinical use.
  Project by Surabhi Fadnavis. The code, analysis, text, and video were produced
  with AI tools (Cursor).
keywords:
  - breast ultrasound
  - lesion segmentation
  - BUSI
  - external validation
  - ONNX
  - research demo
